    <briefdescription>
<para>Performs liveness detection and anti-spoof verification. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Validates that audio is:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Live speech (not pre-recorded or synthetic)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Not a replay of previous audio</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>From the expected speaker</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Within expected acoustic characteristics </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
